        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKiVHQdM4N3tCTq6-sUVJxppm3ROpmvp29Jqu-R9ZiS88L5w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
      },
      "publishTime": "2025-10-18T13:27:47.690325278Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/review/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paWGExUjJhM2xMT1ZSVVpFZHVZVFJRUzBob2VXYxAB&d=17924085&t=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paWGExUjJhM2xMT1ZSVVpFZHVZVFJRUzBob2VXYxAB!2m1!1s0x357ca3000369fd77:0x93fb198373d0cb59"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJd_1pAwCjfDURWcvQc4MZ-5M/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKalZUVm1Ta2RhWVc1M1ZXaGlVamg2UzNKNlJtYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I loved this restaurant! I especially recommend ordering the eel: it's simply delicious. The shrimp were also excellent, fresh and tasty. Yes, the prices aren't the lowest, but the quality totally justifies it. A great place if you want to enjoy a truly good meal.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "¡Me encantó este restaurante! Recomiendo especialmente pedir la anguila: está simplemente deliciosa. Los camarones también fueron excelentes, frescos y sabrosos. Sí, los precios no son los más bajos, pero la calidad lo justifica totalmente. Un lugar estupendo si quieres disfrutar de una comida realmente buena",
        "languageCode": "es"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "Oleh Nariichuk",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105606899777252901247/reviews",
        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCzBO5evj2ZBuKCQ1Y9SR-mc-7XDQnfr1UlLfz6Y33dxhIPzU4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7"
      },
      "publishTime": "2025-09-24T13:50:21.730145919Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/review/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKalZUVm1Ta2RhWVc1M1ZXaGlVamg2UzNKNlJtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKalZUVm1Ta2RhWVc1M1ZXaGlVamg2UzNKNlJtYxAB!2m1!1s0x357ca3000369fd77:0x93fb198373d0cb59"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJd_1pAwCjfDURWcvQc4MZ-5M/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kSmNuTnRUVlJHY0RSVFlta3hSV3N4UjNSSGFtYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "A restaurant where you can taste clean and light eel without any fishy smell.\nIt goes well with grilled vegetables (lotus root, mushrooms, eggplant, sesame, onion, asparagus) and\nside dishes (gungchae namul, white kimchi, garlic, etc.), and the steamed eel soup is a delicacy (different taste from chueotang).\nYou can choose from various types of seats such as halls and rooms.\nIt is a famous restaurant for Sung Si-kyung, and it is also a restaurant that I personally visit when I think of grilled eel.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "비린 냄새가 없고, 깔끔하고 담백한 장어를 맛볼 수 있는 음식점.\n채소구이(연근, 버섯, 가지, 마, 양파, 아스파라거스) 및\n밑반찬 (궁채나물, 백김치, 마늘 등)과 잘 어울리며, 찐~~~한 장어탕은 별미 (추어탕과는 다른 맛)\n홀, 룸 등 다양한 형태의 자리를 선택할 수 있음.\n성시경 맛집이고, 개인적으로도 장어구이 생각나면 오는 음식점.",
        "languageCode": "ko"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "JJANGA K",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104626619134550360461/reviews",
        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI6QOcZ-MEuCuEI83bOxSNfV4zfKY76ONpGyZ05UP0oo60jwA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
      },
      "publishTime": "2025-06-08T13:33:41.498009419Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/review/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kSmNuTnRUVlJHY0RSVFlta3hSV3N4UjNSSGFtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kSmNuTnRUVlJHY0RSVFlta3hSV3N4UjNSSGFtYxAB!2m1!1s0x357ca3000369fd77:0x93fb198373d0cb59"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJd_1pAwCjfDURWcvQc4MZ-5M/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGS1NHSlZOVTVtVG1rdFMwRnRkSEpVUkhSVGVXYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I had lunch in the room. It was quiet. The mud flat eel was large, chewy, and delicious. For dessert, I had lily noodles, which were refreshing and cool.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "룸에서 점심식사를 했는데 조용하고 갯벌장어가 크기도 컸지만 쫀득하면서도 맛있어요 후식으로 백합국수 시원하고 개운해요",
        "languageCode": "ko"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "김진숙",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110041277176505015258/reviews",
        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1ogWetUB4CgEuWYCzgUVHub_AxQNDIRBh65gGDkMnAT8ci7praw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
      },
      "publishTime": "2025-09-28T07:03:54.467899814Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/review/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGS1NHSlZOVTVtVG1rdFMwRnRkSEpVUkhSVGVXYxAB&d=17924085&t=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGS1NHSlZOVTVtVG1rdFMwRnRkSEpVUkhSVGVXYxAB!2m1!1s0x357ca3000369fd77:0x93fb198373d0cb59"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJd_1pAwCjfDURWcvQc4MZ-5M/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOTWFrMHdhVkJtZVhwVFdqaGhVbGRGZFVsMlgwRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 weeks ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "If you're craving a lot of eel, I wouldn't recommend this place. It's expensive and not particularly special. However, the restaurant is clean and the staff are friendly, so it's a good place to go if you want a good spot.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "배터지게 장어를 먹고 싶다면 그다지 추천하고 싶지는 않다. 가격이 비싸고 아주 특별한 맛이 있는 것도 아니다. 다만, 매장이 깔끔하고 직원들이 친절하므로 좋은 자리 하고 싶을 때 가면 좋다",
        "languageCode": "ko"
      },
      "authorAttribution": {
        "displayName": "박순수",
        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111373656807367890043/reviews",
